# The station role: the board joins the LAB access point (the Mac, or a
# second board) and measures the DOWNLINK CSI. This is the role the original
# image used, so the behaviour is known.
#
# Build it into its own directory and its own sdkconfig, so the two roles
# can never overwrite each other:
#
#   idf.py -B build -D SDKCONFIG=sdkconfig.station \
#          -D SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.station.defaults" build
CONFIG_SPECTER_ROLE_STATION=y
# CONFIG_SPECTER_ROLE_SOFTAP is not set
